{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45611","headline":"循吏曲上王使君 · 贯休","name":"循吏曲上王使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"需宿需宿，炳烂光合。\n蒸蒸婺民，锺此多福。\n自东自西，自南自北。\n伊飞伊走，乳乳良牧。\n和气无形，春光自成。\n大信不信，贻厥无朕。\n需女需女，尔亦须语。\n使君爲理，玄风震古。\n需女需女，尔亦须语。\n我愿喙长三千里，枕着玉阶奏明主。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}